sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as Browser
    participant P1 as BFF replica
    participant P2 as Redis
    participant P3 as Identity Provider
    P0->>P1: POST logout and CSRF
    P1->>P2: Invalidate shared session
    P1->>P2: Delete token record
    P1->>P0: Clear cookie; return logout URL
    P0->>P3: Top-level OIDC logout
    P3->>P0: Return to registered UI
    P0->>P1: GET session
    P1->>P0: 401 unauthenticated
